    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 9707408b7d8188a8c7817faf5323db2ca4ee42ea -->\n**Review (M3, docs): clean. The one conflict is `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`, renumbered at merge time.**\n- The 20 added rows cover every registered tool that lacked one. After the merge, all 71 registered tools have a row.\n- Each row's arguments match the schema in `crates/app/src/mcp`: names, enums, ranges, array lengths and required fields. Spot checks include `locate_part`'s mates, `place_on_plate`, `detect_pockets` and `set_setup_nose_to_axis`.\n- No vendor text.\n- **Merge-time refresh:** `SKILL.md` merges cleanly. `PROCESS_VERSION` is 42 here and main is now at 43, so take the next free number at merge and add the #681 line.\n",
